cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use nyx in your research, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
title: "nyx: Differentiable Simulation of Night Sky Background in Imaging Atmospheric Cherenkov Telescopes"
abstract: >-
  nyx models the night sky background for IACT telescopes, enabling parameter
  estimation through HMC fitting or gradient-based optimization.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: "Roellinghoff"
    given-names: "Gerrit"
    email: "gerrit.roellinghoff@fau.de"
version: "0.1.0"
license: BSD-3-Clause
repository-code: "https://github.com/GerritRo/nyx"
url: "https://gerritro.github.io/nyx/"
keywords:
  - sky-brightness
  - atmosphere
  - astronomy
  - astrophysics
  - jax
  - differentiable
# Note: nyx bundles and downloads third-party datasets that carry their own
